<title>JAPAN: Japan ethylene output hits highest ever Aug level.</title>
<headline>Japan ethylene output hits highest ever Aug level.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's ethylene production last month hit the highest ever level for August at 615,000 tonnes, up 4.2 percent from a year earlier, an official at the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>It is the first time ethylene production for August has surpassed 600,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Stable growth in domestic demand, in line with a gradual recovery in Japan's overall economy, was behind the rise in output, an official for the Japan Petrochemical Industry Association said.</p>
</text>
